OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in Need: From delayed
OL,4,Aspeech to singing for the nation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPopping moves and singing along to
OL,7,FMichael Jackson tunes, 16-year-old
OL,8,FDavid is quite the showman at his youth
OL,9,Fclub in Dagenham, east London.
OL,11,FIt's run by the charity, Enabling
OL,12,FIndependence, and until David started
OL,13,Fsessions with them when he was eight,
OL,14,Fhis mum Itohan said he could not even
OL,15,Fsay "mummy" and "daddy".
OL,17,FDavid was diagnosed with autism
OL,18,Fspectrum disorder when he was three and
OL,19,Fexperienced speech delay.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
